---
const newSite = "https://rongyu-notes.rongyu1104.chatgpt.site/";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content={`0; url=${newSite}`} />
    <link rel="canonical" href={newSite} />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/images/favicon-32.png" />
    <title>网站已迁移 | RongYu's Notes</title>
    <script is:inline define:vars={{ newSite }}>
      window.location.replace(newSite);
    </script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <p class="wordmark">RongYu's Notes</p>
      <h1>网站已迁移</h1>
      <p>正在前往新站。如未自动跳转，请点击下方链接。</p>
      <a href={newSite}>前往新站 →<span>{newSite}</span></a>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(html) {
    color: #1e2b2a;
    background: #f5f8f7;
    font-family: "Times New Roman", "Songti SC", "SimSun", serif;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  :global(body) {
    margin: 0;
  }

  main {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    width: min(100%, 42rem);
    margin: 12vh auto;
    padding: 2rem;
  }

  .wordmark {
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(30, 43, 42, 0.18);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  a {
    color: #7d3345;
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  }

  a:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid #7d3345;
    outline-offset: 4px;
  }

  a span {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
</style>
